SUMMARY:[Clayman Institute for Gender Research] Book Talk: What Tech Calls
  Governing
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261001T120000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261001T130000
DTSTAMP:20261001T184312Z
