DESCRIPTION:Expanding upon the work begun in What Tech Calls Thinking\, Ad
 rian Daub explores which ideas of politics\, power\, and dominance charact
 erize the tech industry\, and how those ideas came to be.\n\nTech companie
 s increasingly determine who regulates and who governs. And the tech elite
  increasingly wield political power\, seeking to remake your workplace\, y
 our child's school\, and the federal government in their image. But what d
 o they mean by power?\n\nTaking readers from investor meetings to lecture 
 halls\n\nAges: All ages\nLast synced: 2026-10-01 11:43 PDT
LOCATION:Carolyn Lewis Attneave House
END:VEVENT
