UID:stanford_campus-localist-54064324667679-54064324667680@local-events
DESCRIPTION:What is the relationship between capitalism and freedom in the
  United States? This question has motivated a generation of scholars who h
 ave looked to the history of American slavery to better understand the ori
 gins of American capitalism. But scholars have yet to fully grapple with t
 he ways in which enslaved people\, both as property and as economic agents
 \, understood the complicated logics of American capitalism. This presenta
 tion\, organized in collaboration with the Slavery and Freedom workshop\n
